  Reel_script says the officers were led by Inspector Chinnathangam ('தலைமையிலான'), while the article only says the police inspector Chinnathangam 'உள்ளிட்ட போலீசாருக்கு' a tip was received and that police patrolled; the article does not state he led the patrol, so this is an embellished role claim.
